    "content": {
      "text": "Most families are not missing scholarship money because their child is unqualified.\n\nThey’re missing it because nobody told them where to look.\n\nThousands of dollars in scholarships are available for high school students, college students, women in technology, mothers returning to school and families who simply need financial support.\n\nBut here’s the truth:\n\nYou cannot apply for an opportunity you never knew existed.\n\nSave this list. Research every scholarship. Confirm the requirements and deadlines on each organization’s official website—and start applying early.\n\nDo not automatically count yourself out.\n\nLet the scholarship committee tell you no. Never reject yourself before submitting the application.\n\nSHARE this with a student, parent, teacher, coach or counselor. One share could help change someone’s entire future.\n\nComment “SCHOLARSHIP” if you want me to send you where you can find more opportunities like these, for free. \n\nAnd no, I don’t charge or try and upsell you in your DM’s either! \n\nLove you guys. \n\n- Coach @gerald_smiley",
