      "text": "Scholarships in Canada 2027 | Study in Canada\n\nApply Link: https://brightscholarship.com/scholarships-in-canada-2027/\n\nUniversity: Canadian Universities\nDegree level: Bachelors, Masters, PhD\nScholarship coverage: Fully Funded\nEligible nationality: All Nationalities\nAward country: Canada\nLast date: Vary with University\n\n#BrightScholarship #FullyFunded #Scholarship #Canada #Students",
