    "content": {
      "text": "$100,000s in FREE money… and the only thing standing between you and it might be 30 minutes of your time.\n\nEvery year, millions of dollars in scholarships go unclaimed.\n\nNot because students aren’t smart enough.\n\nNot because they aren’t deserving.\n\nBut because they never apply.\n\nToo many students tell themselves:\n\n* “I probably won’t win.”\n* “Someone else is more qualified.”\n* “I’ll do it later.”\n\nThen the deadline passes.\n\nThe students who receive scholarships aren’t always the ones with the highest GPA or the most talent. They’re often the ones who simply took the time to fill out the application.\n\nOver the next couple of days, block off an hour.\n\nTurn off your notifications.\nPut your phone down.\nOpen your laptop.\nApply for every scholarship on this list that you’re eligible for.\n\nOne application could save you thousands of dollars.\n\nEven if it takes you an hour to complete an application and you win a $5,000 scholarship, that’s one of the highest hourly “paychecks” you’ll ever earn.\n\nDon’t let procrastination cost you opportunities that could change your future.\n\nYour future self will never regret applying.\n\nBut you might regret not applying.\n\nSave this post. Share it with a student or parent. Then come back after you’ve submitted your applications and let me know how many you completed.\n\nWhich scholarship are you applying for first?\n\nComment “scholarship” and I’ll send you a list of scholarships and places to look for free money. \n\n#scholarshipopportunities #scholarshipalert #collegemoney #collegescholarships #financialaid",
      "language": "en",
